  "postresolution_255_plan_excerpt": "STRATEGIC ROLE (deterministic board math, recomputed now): CONTROL/STABILIZE \u2014 dead in 2 turns even after casting Tamiyo's Safekeeping (T10) (1 vs 2 creatures, 1 vs 10 power) \u2014 stabilize: block, remove, gain life; attack with The Notary Hobbits: dead on T11; hold: dead on T13 [game plan (turn 9) said DEFENDER; these board facts are newer \u2014 follow them]\n  THIS TURN (T10, now): play Yavimaya, Cradle of Growth; cast Kogla, the Titan Ape; attack: none; hold: no instants in hand; keep Notary tokens back as blockers/mana [game plan T9, written before the opponent's board changed: re-check its attacks]\n  FACTS: they kill us in 2 attack(s) (their next attack: 6 -> you at 1), we kill them in \u2014 | race BEHIND (they kill in 2, we get nothing through) | life 7 vs 25 | clock leaves out: Hulk, Brutal Brawler (attack trigger) | !! DEAD IN 2 TURNS UNLESS WE STABILIZE\n  NEXT: T12: cast Icetill Explorer; attack: none; hold: keep Titan/Vaultborn until 7 mana; spend spare mana this turn: unused mana empties at the end of each step and phase | T14: no cast; attack: none; hold: no castable play at 6 mana; hold Kogla as blocker, wait for a land/draw to reach Titan\n  Board: us 1 creatures/1 power vs them 2/10 | hand 6 vs 1 | lands 4 + land drop vs 5\n  Threats: Hulk, Brutal Brawler (6/6); Bristly Bill, Spine Sower (4/4)\n  Priority: survive first \u2014 creatures that block, removal on attackers and life gain before card draw, mana rocks, cycling or bouncing cheap creatures.\n\nGAME PLAN (formed turn 9 \u2014 your strategic spine for this game):\n  Win condition(s): Kogla/Titan beatdown after big-mana ramp; Notary token swarm into Craterhoof/Finale alpha strike\n  Path to win: T10 Kogla fights Warden dead and blocks; T12 Icetill ramps lands; then Titan/Vaultborn at 7 mana.\n  Switch if: they tap out with no blockers -> attack with Kogla; draw a mana dork or extra land -> ramp toward Titan; Bill grows past our blockers -> tutor Finale/Craterhoof\n  Biggest threat: Bristly Bill indestructible counter engine pl \u2026[truncated]"
